---
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
import "../styles/elements/career.css";
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Dumitru Birsan - Full Stack Developer"
	pubDate={new Date("November 21 2025")}
>
	<h2>The Developer Forged by Change</h2>
	<p>
		My journey began in Anenii Noi, Moldova, moved through Romania, and took
		root in the industrial heartland of Italy. This migration path taught me
		a fundamental truth: any system—whether a new spoken language or a
		legacy codebase—can be mastered with patience and resilience.
	</p>
	<p>
		Today, I operate at the intersection of Industrial IoT (IIoT) and Modern
		Web Architecture. I don’t just build websites; I engineer the digital
		nervous systems for industrial machinery, bridging the gap between
		high-level Cloud abstractions and the reality of factory hardware. I am
		fluent in Romanian, Italian, and English, and I speak the languages of
		machines (Serial/TCP) and the web (React/Node) with equal proficiency.
	</p>

	<h2>The Architect of Industry 4.0</h2>
	<p>
		In software, "Full Stack" usually implies Database to Frontend. In my
		world, "Full Stack" goes deeper—from the RS-232 serial cable plugged
		into a robot, through a Node.js gateway, up to the Azure Cloud, and back
		down to a real-time React dashboard.
	</p>
	<p>Currently, as a Senior Developer at Change Wave SRL, I focus on:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>The "Air-Gapped" Solution:</strong> Architecting robust Electron
			applications that deliver modern UX to offline industrial environments,
			secured by Sentinel API licensing.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Visual Logic:</strong> Building custom "Drag-and-Drop" Automation
			Editors (via React Flow/Konva) that allow engineers to program logic
			visually.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Event-Driven Systems:</strong> Orchestrating microservices via
			RabbitMQ and Socket.io
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>The Community Citizen</h2>
	<p>
		Technology is nothing without the people who build it. I believe in
		being a "Producer" of the tech ecosystem, not just a consumer. In 2025,
		I shifted from attendee to leader, serving as Staff for DevFest Modena
		and as an active ally for Women Techmakers (WTM) Modena, contributing to
		the web infrastructure (Hugo/Sass) for both.
	</p>

	<h2>Offline Mode</h2>
	<p>
		When I am not debugging race conditions, I am recharging my "Stamina"
		bar. You will find me hiking the Apennine mountains, practicing yoga to
		maintain physical agility, or analyzing complex skill trees in my
		favorite ARPGs.
	</p>

	<h2>Career Journey</h2>
	<div class="career-timeline">
		<!-- Job 1 -->
		<div class="career-card">
			<span class="career-date">Jul 2023 - Present</span>
			<h3 class="career-role">Senior Full Stack Developer</h3>
			<div class="career-company">Change Wave srl</div>
			<p class="career-description">
				Leading development of industrial IoT solutions and modern web
				architectures.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Job 2 -->
		<div class="career-card">
			<span class="career-date">Oct 2020 - May 2023</span>
			<h3 class="career-role">Web Engineer</h3>
			<div class="career-company">INDUSTRIA TECNOLOGICA ITALIANA SRL</div>
			<p class="career-description">
				Focused on web engineering and software development for
				industrial applications.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Job 3 -->
		<div class="career-card">
			<span class="career-date">Dec 2019 - Feb 2021</span>
			<h3 class="career-role">Analyst Programmer</h3>
			<div class="career-company">
				CIS Scoula per la Gestione d'Impresa
			</div>
			<p class="career-description">
				Professional Qualification Certificate (Level EQF: 6).
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
